 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Don’t Mind Me, Daddy"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "Dad, I Won't Do Anything"
   },
   {
    "en": "Father, I Will Never Forgive You!"
   },
   {
    "en": "Father, I Won't Do Anything"
   },
   {
    "ko": "아빠, 저는 아무것도 하지 않을게요"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Jayna’s life is a parade of misfortunes: born to a dragon mother who dies early, bullied by other dragons throughout her childhood, disregarded by her human father, and murdered as a teenager. At least, according to the novel she’s been reborn in. At 10 years old, she’s given the chance to live with her father, the Master of the Magic Tower, Diamid. She’s aware her father and destiny will not be kind to her, so her only goal is to enjoy the small luxuries of life until she dies at 17. But will this life truly be the same tragedy?"
  },
